.SH NOTES
The framework is designed to be crash-resistant. Every phase is wrapped in
exception handling, ensuring the scan always completes and generates a report
even if individual phases fail.
.PP
For best results, run with appropriate permissions and respect target systems'
rate limits. Always obtain proper authorization before scanning.
